  "code": "def bubble(a):\n    n = len(a)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(0, n - i - 1):\n            if a[j] > a[j + 1]:\n                a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]\n    return a\n\nbubble([5, 1, 4, 2])\n",
